	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"KEN OKUYAMA DESIGNによる構造検証を経て、ジョウガンの改良機、「ジョウガン改」をHGで立体化！",
			"• 「境界戦機」第二部より、鉄塚ガシンが搭乗。自律思考型AI ケイを移植し、大火力を有する機体に生まれ変わった。",
			"• 機体正面に向けて大型のガトリング、背部には大型のドラムマガジンを装着、圧倒的な火力で敵を制圧する。",
			"• リアスカートにはガトリングの反動から機体を支える為、バイポットを内蔵。パーツ差替えにより設置状態に展開可能。",
			"• 両肩のシールドはガトリング基部の装甲と連結し、防御力の高い状態を再現。",
			"• 本体前面の装甲には携行短機関砲２丁を収納可能。",
			"TVアニメ「境界戦機」第二部は４月開始！！第一部のエピソードはBANDAI SPIRITS 公式 YouTubeにて全話無料配信中！"
		],
		"en": [
			"After structural verification by KEN OKUYAMA DESIGN, the improved version of Jougan, \"Jougan Kai\", has been made into a three-dimensional HG model!",
			"• From the second part of \"Kyoukai Senki\", Tetsuzuka Gasin is on board. It has been implanted with the autonomous thinking AI Kei and has been reborn as a machine with great firepower.",
			"• A large gatling is attached to the front of the aircraft, and a large drum magazine is attached to the back, suppressing the enemy with overwhelming firepower.",
			"• The rear skirt has a built-in bipot to support the aircraft from the recoil of Gatling. Can be expanded to installed state by replacing parts.",
			"• The Seals on both shoulders are connected to the armor at the base of the Gatling to recreate a highly defensive state.",
			"• Two portable submachine guns can be stored in the armor on the front of the main body.",
			"The second part of the TV anime \"Kyoukai Senki\" starts in 4! ! All episodes of the first part are available for free on BANDAI SPIRITS official YouTube!"
		]
	},
